:: BadEnd {"position":"475,1475","size":"100,100"}
You lower your sword and step back.

The soldiers move without hesitation. Spears flash in the dim light as screams fill the chamber. One by one, the families fall. Blood flows and mixes with the golden Elixir pulsing through the pipes.

The Veiled Heretic looks at you one final time.
"So this is the Light you serve…"

Moments later, Malphas arrives. He places a heavy hand on your shoulder, his voice warm with approval.
"Well done, my pupil. You have proven your unwavering faith. The Light is stronger because of knights like you."

You are praised as a hero. The incident is quickly buried. Above, the golden Aegis shines brighter than ever.

Yet that night, as you kneel in prayer at the Shrine, you notice a faint violet vein pulsing beneath the skin of your wrist. The Corruption bar flickers briefly… before the holy light suppresses it.

You tell yourself it is nothing.

Achievement Unlocked: "Faithful Blade"

The lie endures. The machine grinds on. And you remain its willing servant… for now.

[[Try again with a different choice.|MeetTheHeretics]]


:: BossFightPhase1 [8] {"position":"600,1850","size":"100,100"}
Steel clashes against divine gold. Malphas’s staff blazes with radiant power, each strike shaking the chamber.

[[Perfect Parry|BossFightPhase2]]
[[Dodge and strike|BossFightPhase2]]


:: BossFightPhase2 [8] {"position":"600,1975","size":"100,100"}
With a roar of anguish, Malphas unleashes ''"Divine Judgement"'' — a colossal pillar of blinding light that shatters the floor beneath your feet.

You plummet into darkness. Your armor cracks. Your sword snaps in two. A cold violet energy begins to seep from your arm…

//''Corruption has begun.''//

[[Continue|EndingChapter1]]


:: BossMalphas [8] {"position":"600,1725","size":"100,100"}
<script>
