The Grand Plaza of Luminaria stretches beneath the eternal golden disc of the Aegis. Thousands of white rose petals swirl in a perfectly choreographed wind as you kneel on cold marble, the weight of your ceremonial plate armor pressing into your knees.

[[Continue.|Start 2]]


:: Start 2 [1] {"position":"675,225","size":"100,100"}
High Inquisitor Malphas stands before you. He slowly lowers the massive golden greatsword until its humming edge rests upon your pauldron.

[[Continue.|MalphasDL]]


:: TVH [5] {"position":"725,1350","size":"100,100"}
An old figure steps out from the shadows. His robes are torn and his body shows signs of Void corruption, yet his eyes remain sharp and clear.

[[Reply to the mysterious man|VeiledHereticDL]]


:: TheChoice [7] {"position":"600,1600","size":"100,100"}
Suddenly, Church soldiers burst into the chamber, spears raised.

"Heretics!" one shouts. "By order of the Inquisitor — purge them all!"

The families scream in terror, pressing against the humming Elixir machines. The golden armor of the soldiers now feels cold and merciless.

[[Draw your sword and protect the families.|BossMalphas]] 
[[Stand aside and obey the Church's decree.|BadEnd]]


:: TheFirstMission [1] {"position":"525,475","size":"100,100"}
The cheers of the crowd fade into the background as a breathless messenger stumbles forward. He whispers urgently to Malphas about a breach in the Eastern Infrastructure — a dangerous seepage of the Void.

Malphas turns his blindfolded gaze toward the eastern spires.

[[Continue.|TheFirstMission2]]


:: TheFirstMission2 [1] {"position":"675,475","size":"100,100"}
<img src="https://files.catbox.moe/iktgt6.png" class="standing-sprite">
<div class="char-name">High Inquisitor Malphas</div>
"A test so soon? The Light works in mysterious ways." He places a firm hand on your shoulder. "Go, Knight. Purge this infection before it reaches the Commoners’ Quarter. Grant them the mercy of a swift end."

[[Head to the Eastern Sewers.|OTW]]


:: VeiledHeretic [5] {"position":"600,1350","size":"100,100"}
<img src="https://files.catbox.moe/4jzvyy.png" class="mcstanding-sprite">
You hesitate, then speak softly: "Are you alright? Why are you hiding here?"

The mysterious man tilts his head slightly before replying as above.

[[Continue|TVH]]


:: VeiledHereticDL [5] {"position":"850,1350","size":"100,100"}
<img src="https://files.catbox.moe/z4gwfg.png" class="standing-sprite">
<div class="char-name">The Mysterious Man</div>
"Stay your blade, Knight," he says calmly. "I am not the monster your masters claim me to be."

[[Reply to the mysterious man|Reply]]


